66..143 Comment "//! `Magma` has one sort, a binary operation and a constant. `ua[n, k]` reads"
144..202 Comment "//! its binary and constant corollas one degree at a time."
203..206 Comment "//!"
207..277 Comment "//! Other sources import `Magma` and its translators. `exchange` swaps"
278..356 Comment "//! booleans, `boolId` preserves them and `keep` preserves the unit injection."
